    "description": "Have a delicious bowl of Chipotle’s best side dish from the comfort of your own home. In this video, Nicole shows you how to make a copycat recipe for Chipotle’s lime cilantro rice. After simmering a pot of buttered rice, stir in chopped cilantro, lime juice, and plenty of lime zest. The lime juice and zest adds a complimentary sour taste to the cilantro’s freshness. It’s a flavorful side that can be made in under thirty minutes!",
